<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's Jan oil exports at 5.33 mln barrels.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's Jan oil exports at 5.33 mln barrels.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador exported 5.33 million barrels of crude oil in January, down from the 7.48 million shipped during the same month last year, the state oil firm Petroecuador said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The crude oil exported last month was also down from the 7.34 million barrels exported in December 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;Two or three shipments were postponed which had destinations in the Far East. But this will be recovered in February,&quot; a Petroecuador spokesman said.</p>
<p>((--Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
</text>
